1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
오늘 누가, 괜찮냐고 물어봤나요?
Did anyone ask if you're okay today?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,733
오드리 로드는 말했어요.
Audre Lorde wrote,

3
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:12,601
나를 돌보는 건 나를 지키는 일이라고.
"Caring for myself is not self-indulgence, it is self-preservation."

4
00:00:12,701 --> 00:00:19,308
다 챙긴 밤, 내 안부는 아무도 안 물었죠.
After taking care of everyone,
no one asked about me.

5
00:00:19,408 --> 00:00:23,500
너무 괜찮아 보여서일지도요.
Maybe because I looked so fine.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오늘은 제가 물을게요. 괜찮으세요?
Today, I'll ask.
Are you okay?
